    - target: {fileID: 5250526870702089069, guid: 214324f6677dc394d81b5c93ccfefb88, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The moon is the eath''s only moon.

        As this might be just a
        bit confusing the astronomical term is "natural sattelite".

        The
        moon''s diameteris about 3476km so it is about a quarter of the earth''s
        diameter.

        This means that this is not the moon. It is way bigger
        than this.'
